title: vsqrt.f64: sqrt(-0) = -0, sqrt(-1) = default NaN, sqrt(denormal) = +0
ref: A8.8 VSQRT T1; A2.7 FPSqrt(): zero returns FPZero(sign), a negative operand is an invalid operation (FPDefaultNaN), FPUnpack() flushes the denormal (FPSCR = 0x03000000 on iOS (DN, FZ, round to nearest; ADR 0022))

[code]
b1eec01b    vsqrt.f64 d1, d0
b1eec32b    vsqrt.f64 d2, d3
b1eec54b    vsqrt.f64 d4, d5
7047        bx lr

[in]
d0 = 0x8000000000000000
d3 = f64:-1.0
d5 = 0x0000000000000004

[out]
d1 = 0x8000000000000000
d2 = 0x7FF8000000000000
d4 = 0
